          "title": "CVE-2024-5998 — LangChain",
          "url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-5998",
          "excerpt": "A vulnerability in the FAISS.deserialize_from_bytes function of langchain-ai/langchain allows for pickle deserialization of untrusted data. This can lead to the execution of arbitrary commands via the os.system function. The issue affects the latest version of the product.",
